  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>朱奕臣、王晞竹等</span> <span>2026-08-04 22:05</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">上海</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182345_405dda0.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p>OpenAI关停独立浏览器Atlas；中国模型调用量连续14周领跑OpenRouter……</p>\n  <div style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011257\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182346_80b688c.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: right;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: PingFangSC-light;color: rgb(127, 127, 127);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">撰文：朱奕臣、王晞竹、陈欣越、吴一凡</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"text-align: right;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;font-family: PingFangSC-light;color: rgb(127, 127, 127);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑：吴洋洋</span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"transform-origin: center center;-webkit-transform-origin: center center;-moz-transform-origin: center center;-o-transform-origin: center center;margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: -10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;background-color: rgb(248, 247, 243);padding: 29px 20px;height: auto;margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;font-size: 23px;color: rgb(177, 8, 8);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(213, 108, 76);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Key Points</span></strong></span></p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国模型调用量连续14周领跑OpenRouter；</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">应对DeepSeek、Kimi新模型，OpenAI模型最高降价80%；</span></span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Questmobile：豆包、千问和DeepSeek月活分别3.82亿、1.67亿和1.30亿，Kimi降至729万；</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Qwen3.8-Max下周开源；</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁机器人子公司开启独立融资；</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n        <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-10px, 0px, 0px);margin: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n         <div style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 15px;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n          <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">帕西尼融资10亿元。</span></p>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">中国模型调用量连续14周领跑OpenRouter</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">据全球最大AI聚合平台OpenRouter最新周度数据，上周（7月27日至8月2日），全球调用量前五名均为中国AI大模型，这是中国大模型周调用量连续第14周超过美国模型。其中：</span></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek-V4-Flash周调用量达7.22万亿Token，环比增长13%，升至第一；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">小米MiMo-V2.5位居第二，周调用量6.3万亿Token，环比下滑40%；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯Hy3排名第三，周调用量4.82万亿Token，环比增长22%；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek-V4-Pro升至第四，周调用量3.28万亿Token，环比增长3%；</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱GLM-5.2位列第五，周调用量2.89万亿Token，环比下滑12%。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在全球十大热门模型榜单中，中国模型占据了九个席位。OpenAI旗下GPT-5.6 Luna首次登上榜单，位居第八，周调用量达1.95万亿Token，环比增长456%。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">7月31日，DeepSeek-V4-Flash正式版API上线公测。当天，模型评测平台Artificial Analysis实测了128款大模型，结果显示，DeepSeek-V4-Flash在智能指数测试环节拿到了50分（满分100分），距离OpenAI的GPT-5.6 Luna（51分）仅差1分。价格方面，据Artificial Analysis测算，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">DeepSeek-V4-Flash每百万输入Token收费0.14美元、输出Token收费0.28美元，运行成本不到Anthropic旗舰模型的1%。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在DeepSeek-V4-Flash公测前一天，OpenAI宣布对GPT-5.6系列大幅调价。轻量级模型Luna降价80%，每百万Token输出价格从6美元降至1.2美元。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">不过，从调用总量看，OpenRouter上周数据显示，全球AI大模型总调用量为56.8万亿Token，环比下滑2.07%。其中，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">中国AI大模型周调用量达28.13万亿Token，环比下滑14.76%；同期美国AI大模型周调用量为4.38万亿Token，环比增长87.18%。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考链接：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://openrouter.ai/rankings\" target=\"_blank\">https://openrouter.ai/rankings</a></span><a class=\"wx_topic_link\" topic-id=\"mse7m5qk-8l1vau\" style=\"color: #576B95 !important;\" data-topic=\"1\" data-recommend=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">#leaderboard</span></a><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">-table</span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">应对DeepSeek、Kimi新模型，OpenAI模型最高降价80%</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">7月30日，OpenAI宣布下调GPT‑5.6系列两款模型的API价格。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">其中，面向高频、低成本任务的GPT‑5.6 Luna输入和输出价格均下降80%，其中<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">输出价由每百万Token6美元降至1.2美元。这个价格较Kimi K3每百万token 15美元的输出价格低92%，不过仍远高于DeepSeekV4 Pro的0.87美元和DeepSeek V4 Flash的0.28美元。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">另外，定位日常工作的GPT‑5.6 Terra降价20%，输出价格由15美元降至12美元；旗舰模型GPT‑5.6 Sol价格保持不变。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考链接：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.6-luna\" target=\"_blank\">https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-5.6-luna</a></span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/\" target=\"_blank\">https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/</a></span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://www.kimi.com/blog/kimi-k3\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kimi.com/blog/kimi-k3</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI关停独立浏览器Atlas，功能整合进ChatGPT</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">7月29日，OpenAI发布公告，宣布旗下独立AI浏览器Atlas将于8月9日停止运行。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Atlas于去年10月上线，运营不足一年。OpenAI称，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">将把Atlas的浏览器智能体能力整合进ChatGPT桌面应用和Chrome扩展程序中</span>，未来ChatGPT将支持多标签页、下载、账号登录等更强浏览功能。不过，用户的书签、历史记录和打开的标签页不会自动迁移，需在停服前手动导出。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">关停原因可能与用户习惯有关。Atlas作为一个独立浏览器，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">与用户长久形成的浏览器使用习惯存在显著差异，用户需要额外的学习成本和迁移门槛。</span>此外，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">随着通用Agent的快速演进，搜索、网页理解、信息整理和任务执行正在成为通用Agent的基础能力</span>，意味着浏览器更适合成为通用Agent的底层能力。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考链接：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://help.openai.com/zh-hans-cn/articles/20001371-evolving-atlas-into-chatgpt-for-browser-based-agentic-work\" target=\"_blank\">https://help.openai.com/zh-hans-cn/articles/20001371-evolving-atlas-into-chatgpt-for-browser-based-agentic-work</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Questmobile：豆包、千问和DeepSeek月活分别3.82亿、1.67亿和1.30亿，Kimi降至729万</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">8月4日，QuestMobile发布《2026中国移动互联网半年报告》。报告显示，截至2026年6月，中国AI原生App月活跃用户规模达到4.99亿，较1月增加1.52亿，同比增长85.4%，成为上半年增长最快的移动互联网行业。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">第一梯队中，豆包、千问和DeepSeek分别以3.82亿、1.67亿和1.30亿月活位居前三，集中了大部分用户流量。</span>3个产品中，豆包6月较5月新增1378万用户，月活同比增长172.1%；千问同比增长5792.9%，为榜单增速第一，但按同比数据反推，其去年同期月活仅约284万；DeepSeek月活同比下降20.3%，但其单次使用10分钟以上的用户占比提高7.8个百分点，说明用户规模下降的同时，深度使用程度仍在提升。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">第二梯队成员有升有降。元宝月活4984万，同比增长100.9%；</span>豆包爱学和即梦AI月活分别为1944万、1633万，仍保持增长；<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">Kimi月活则降至729万，同比下降42.7%。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考链接：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://www.questmobile.com.cn/research/report/2084487578531254273\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.questmobile.com.cn/research/report/2084487578531254273</a></span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1em;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://www.questmobile.com.cn/research/report/2076954943839809537\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.questmobile.com.cn/research/report/2076954943839809537</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Qwen3.8-Max下周开源</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">8月3日，阿里发布Qwen3.8-Max模型。Qwen 3.8-Max基于Qwen 3.5的架构基础构建，参数规模2.4万亿，激活参数95B，支持100万上下文Token。定价上，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">国内每百万Token输入12元、输出36元；海外每百万Token输入2美元、输出6美元。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">这个价格低于Kimi K3每百万token的15美元，高于DeepSeekV4 Pro每百万token的0.87美元和DeepSeek V4 Flash的0.28美元。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">官方称，Qwen3.8-Max在编程、办公以及长周期任务等方面实现了提升，并且能更可靠地端到端完成复杂任务。</span></p>\n    <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在编程相关案例中，Qwen3.8-Max<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">可以从零开始独立完成跨越多天的项目，不需要人中途介入，还能用代码复现论文中的实验，并找到超越论文原方法的新做法。</span></span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在办公领域，官方强调的核心是「干得广且干得好」。一方面，模型在覆盖数百种职业的高频工作场景中完成了压力测试；另一方面，它能端到端交付成果，例如只给一句任务描述，模型连续工作数小时，交出了一套完整的ETF轮动策略。</span></p>\n     </li>\n     <li>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">长周期任务方面，Qwen3.8-Max展现出了自适应学习能力。在一项模拟365天电商经营的测试中，Qwen3.8-Max把和某个供应商磨出来的议价经验，泛化到了同类商品上，而其他模型的议价效率多在测试中期陷入瓶颈。</span></p>\n     </li>\n    </ul>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里称，<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">Qwen3.8-Max将于下周开源，这是阿里旗下首个Max规模的开源权重模型。</span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考链接：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9S8VZETppDj_AidiUFrZlw\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/9S8VZETppDj_AidiUFrZlw</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁机器人子公司开启独立融资</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">8月3日，蚂蚁集团旗下具身智能公司蚂蚁灵波已启动首轮融资，拟募资15亿元，目标在今年年底完成二轮融资。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波成立于2024年12月，由蚂蚁集团全资设立，主要研发可跨本体、跨场景复用的机器人通用大脑，推动AI从数字空间向物理空间延伸。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(202, 89, 89);\">蚂蚁灵波为蚂蚁集团2026年以来第4家独立融资主体。</span>本轮融资后，蚂蚁灵波将继续作为蚂蚁在具身和物理AI领域的核心载体。蚂蚁将在AI Infra、数据资产和应用场景等资源上继续给予灵波支持。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考来源：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_lWd74-MYmvkvHuM5_U7Zg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_lWd74-MYmvkvHuM5_U7Zg</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0%;text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <div style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 10%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: stretch;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n     <div style=\"transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-30px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n      <div style=\"text-align: justify;padding: 0px 20px;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(1, 1, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\">\n       <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">帕西尼融资10亿元</span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 15px;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: PingFangSC-light;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 0.5px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">8月3日，<a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&amp;mid=2247489585&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=aaa1aca550b084594376cbabce7d7240&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"帕西尼\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\">帕西尼</a>宣布获得10亿元战略轮融资，累计融资金额达35亿元，为触觉感知领域累计融资金额最大。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本轮融资由全球消费电子与半导体万亿级巨头、中银国际投资、鲲鹏基金、合信方册联合领投，鼎晖百孚、成都交子人工智能基金、京铭资本、津融国盛联合投资，老股东知来资本等跟投。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">6月，彭博社援引知情人士消息，称帕西尼已接触多家投资银行，评估港交所上市计划。</span></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px;white-space: normal;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\">参考来源：</span></span></span></p>\n    <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(136, 136, 136);\"><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XssaqvHFbW_vwEw-3SDUmQ\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/XssaqvHFbW_vwEw-3SDUmQ</a></span></span></span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"font-size: 12px;color: rgb(90, 88, 88);font-family: PingFangSC-light;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">-END-</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011259\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182345_7729fb9.jpeg\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&amp;mid=2247494903&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=b527cf988e3ab59c23bd2e92fbfb9798&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"字节推出豆包企业版，同时测试Mira、Aime、iDA等办公类智能体｜大公司\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">字节推出豆包企业版，同时测试Mira、Aime、iDA等办公类智能体｜大公司</span></a></span></p>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&amp;mid=2247494887&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=41c409b5c44ee329ba555affc6f3dcd0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"Kimi K3模型技术报告说了什么？\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Kimi K3模型技术报告说了什么？</span></a></span></p>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&amp;mid=2247494863&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4d7bd76953ef52a54d774ab4edd4e5f0&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"硬件之年｜WAIC2026\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">硬件之年｜WAIC2026</span></a></span></p>\n   <p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><a class=\"normal_text_link mp_article_text_link\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"\" href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkwNDQ5MjM1Mw==&amp;mid=2247494782&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d60d644fb913a01c738efa5ceb4a990a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" textvalue=\"对话韩旭：FSD智驾能力95分的话，文远80分，其他人40分｜新皮层\" data-itemshowtype=\"0\" linktype=\"text\" data-linktype=\"2\"><span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">对话韩旭：FSD智驾能力95分的话，文远80分，其他人40分｜新皮层</span></a></span></p>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"1.6472222222222221\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011260\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182346_d65a6e0.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2722222222222222\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011261\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182345_aa95cab.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011258\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182346_86e812f.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.2\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011264\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182346_f5fefea.png\"></p>\n   </div>\n   <div style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-aistatus=\"1\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.1111111111111111\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100011263\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260804182345_73c6ab6.jpeg\"></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"10000\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "本文汇总了近期 AI 领域的多项重大动态，包括中国模型在 OpenRouter 平台连续 14 周领跑调用量、DeepSeek V4 推动 OpenAI 模型大幅降价、OpenAI 关停独立浏览器 Atlas、QuestMobile 数据显示中国 AI 原生 App 月活达 4.99 亿、Qwen3.8-Max 开源计划、蚂蚁机器人子公司独立融资及帕西尼获得 10 亿元战略轮融资等。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "本文汇总了近期 AI 领域的多项重大动态，包括中国模型在 OpenRouter 平台连续 14 周领跑调用量、DeepSeek V4 推动 OpenAI 模型大幅降价、OpenAI 关停独立浏览器 Atlas、QuestMobile 数据显示中国 AI 原生 App 月活达 4.99 亿、Qwen3.8-Max 开源计划、蚂蚁机器人子公司独立融资及帕西尼获得 10 亿元战略轮融资等。",
  "summary": "本文为综合性新闻汇总，涵盖 AI 技术、市场动态及融资事件。首先，OpenRouter 数据显示中国大模型连续 14 周领跑全球调用量，DeepSeek-V4-Flash 以 7.22 万亿 Token 周调用量位列第一。OpenAI 对 GPT-5.6 系列进行大幅降价，其中 Luna 模型输出价格下降 80%至 1.2 美元/百万 Token。OpenAI 宣布于 8 月 9 日关停独立浏览器 Atlas，将其功能整合至 ChatGPT。QuestMobile 报告显示，中国 AI 原生 App 月活达 4.99 亿，豆包、千问、DeepSeek 月活分别为 3.82 亿、1.67 亿和 1.30 亿，Kimi 月活下降 42.7%至 729 万。阿里宣布 Qwen3.8-Max 将于下周开源，参数规模 2.4 万亿，支持 100 万上下文 Token。蚂蚁机器人子公司蚂蚁灵波启动 15 亿元融资，帕西尼获得 10 亿元战略轮融资，累计融资达 35 亿元。",
